{
  "$schema": "https://docs.claude.com/schemas/settings.json",
  "description": "Example settings.json demonstrating agentSettings configuration",
  
  "model": "claude-opus-4-5-20251101",
  
  "agentSettings": {
    "debugging-toolkit:debugger": "inherit",
    "unit-testing:test-automator": "inherit",
    "documentation-generation:docs-architect": "inherit",
    "code-review:reviewer": "claude-sonnet-4-20250514",
    "quick-tasks:simple-helper": "claude-haiku-4-20250513"
  },
  
  "_comment_agentSettings": [
    "agentSettings allows you to override the default model for specific agents.",
    "Format: 'plugin-name:agent-name' as the key, and model name or 'inherit' as the value.",
    "",
    "Model values:",
    "  - 'inherit': Use the parent thread's resolved model (recommended)",
    "  - Specific model name: e.g., 'claude-opus-4-5-20251101', 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'claude-haiku-4-20250513'",
    "",
    "When 'inherit' is specified:",
    "  1. The agent will use the same model as the main thread (specified in 'model' setting above)",
    "  2. The /agents command should display the resolved model, not the literal 'inherit' string",
    "  3. API calls should send the resolved model name, never the string 'inherit'",
    "",
    "Example resolution with current settings:",
    "  - 'debugging-toolkit:debugger' resolves to 'claude-opus-4-5-20251101' (inherited from main thread)",
    "  - 'unit-testing:test-automator' resolves to 'claude-opus-4-5-20251101' (inherited)",
    "  - 'documentation-generation:docs-architect' resolves to 'claude-opus-4-5-20251101' (inherited)",
    "  - 'code-review:reviewer' uses explicit 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514'",
    "  - 'quick-tasks:simple-helper' uses explicit 'claude-haiku-4-20250513'"
  ]
}
